# What finishes Pythagoras' theorem?
subtitle: "Pick the tile that finishes a² + b² = ?, check it on a 3-4-5 triangle, and meet the Babylonian tablet that knew it a thousand years before Pythagoras."

## What finishes Pythagoras' theorem?
text: {"font_size":32}
sources:
    - id: p322
      title: Plimpton 322
      authors: 'ISAW, New York University: Before Pythagoras exhibition'
      year: 2010
      url: https://isaw.nyu.edu/exhibitions/before-pythagoras/items/plimpton-322/
      finding: an Old Babylonian clay tablet (about 1800-1600 BC) listing Pythagorean triples, over a thousand years before Pythagoras

